status:
  scope: >-
    The comparator now targets theorem A and the full theorem B with
    17 < d. B's source declaration has no extra lifting, connectivity or
    homology premise. It quantifies continuous functionals on actual
    convex bodies and a probability measure absolutely continuous with
    respect to Euclidean volume. The independent Challenge reproduces
    the seven original interface definitions. The original B36
    specification is retained as a text archive. The unconditional
    DimensionEighteen module, including almostSix_ninety and the new
    convex-partition theorem, and all proof modules have passed Lean
    compilation. The source-level independence and exact-signature checks
    have passed. The proof sources
    contain no lexical sorry, admit or axiom declaration in this release;
    the two intentional Challenge holes are excluded. The final integrated
    gate passed at 2026-11-24T08:56:01Z in verification/d18-final-retry/:
    all six stages returned zero, all 37 tests passed, and all recorded
    verification inputs were unchanged. The owner audit checked 16765
    declarations from 438 proof-module owners, including 14244 public and
    2521 private declarations, 12586 theorems and 3975 definitions, with
    no opaque declarations. It also checked guards for 90 selected theorems
    and 28 selected definitions. The separate cumulative source rebuild
    passed at 2026-11-24T09:01:10Z in verification/d18-clean-final/ with all
    472 input hashes equal to the main gate and the same owner-audit counts.
    It began with zero project build objects; its final source-only
    synchronization preserved 2214 objects built there and copied no
    working-project objects, as recorded in verification/d18-clean-build/.
    A further clean compilation extracted a single immutable snapshot of
    the final proof inputs from a source ZIP with zero starting project
    objects. Its completed six-stage gate passed at
    2026-11-24T10:23:29Z in verification/d18-archive-final/, with the same
    472 source-input hashes. The first post-build statement-check attempt
    refused an output directory outside that checkout; its corrected run
    passed without changing sources or recompiling project modules.
    Both attempts remain documented in verification/d18-archive-build/.
    The resulting 1314 objects were compared with the kernel-bound main
    objects: 1236 matched bytewise; all stored declarations, types, bodies
    and imports in the remaining 78 objects of 64 modules agreed exactly.
    This final comparison passed at 2026-11-24T10:24:38Z in
    verification/d18-archive-object-comparison/.
    The independent compiled-interface comparison passed at
    2026-11-24T08:59:09Z in verification/d18-compiled-interface/: nine types
    and seven definition bodies are identical, and 419 source files,
    1257 compiled objects and all 1681 bound inputs were unchanged.
    This check does not compare theorem proof bodies. The actual proof
    bodies of theorem A, almostSix_ninety, the unconditional B18 and
    requiredRelativeLifting, with their transitive dependencies, were
    accepted by Lean checker, NanoDa and bundled con-ron at
    2026-11-24T09:15:21Z in verification/d18-kernels/. Each returned zero.
    Their 700996206-byte export has SHA-256
    978d77cdeecf295f3ae79fbc5c18f5d42fb66e911dc7ce0e758925c7d543a0be.
    It contains 58974 theorem records, 17008 definitions, 1381 inductives,
    the three permitted axioms, four quotient records and 38 opaque
    records; these counts include core and library dependencies.
    The approved con-ron 4.36.0-rc1 also accepted the same export at
    2026-11-24T09:18:19Z, exit zero in 109.273 seconds, with unchanged
    checker, export and earlier report. Its evidence is in
    verification/d18-approved-con-ron/. This is a supplemental component
    replay, not the official registry workflow. The new sandboxed
    Comparator attempt in
    verification/d18-comparator/ returned exit 1 after 7.683 seconds:
    bwrap failed to mount tmpfs with No such file or directory. All recorded
    source hashes were unchanged; sandboxing was not bypassed. This is a
    local setup failure before comparison, not a proof rejection. Registry
    verification remains pending. Earlier B36 certificates do not certify
    this B18 release. Dependency source
    integrity passed in verification/d18-dependencies/results.json.
  sorry_count: 0
  sorry_in_definitions: 0
  # The full owner audit passed against this whitelist, including private
  # and generated declarations. This claim is no longer just a token scan.
  axioms: ["propext", "Classical.choice", "Quot.sound"]
  main_results:
    - declaration: "AkopyanSixfold.tverberg_counterexample"
      file: "Solution.lean"
      sorry_count: 0
      axioms: ["propext", "Classical.choice", "Quot.sound"]
      comparator_config: "comparator.json"
      literature_dependencies: []
    - declaration: "AkopyanSixfold.convex_partition_counterexample_gt_17"
      file: "AkopyanResearch/Completion/DimensionEighteen.lean"
      sorry_count: 0
      axioms: ["propext", "Classical.choice", "Quot.sound"]
      comparator_config: "comparator.json"
      literature_dependencies: []

automation:
  methods:
    - method: "agent"
      models: ["GPT-6 Astra Pro"]
      framework: "ChatGPT multi-agent workspace"
