    boundary homotopy were reviewed in
    verification/d18-extension-2026-11-24/STATEMENT_AND_LIFTING_REVIEW.md.
    The separate Mathlib-only reference and semantic checks passed in
    verification/d18-extension-2026-11-24/SEMANTIC_SCOPE_REVIEW.md.
    Publication checks and their source hashes are recorded in
    verification/d18-publication/STATIC_PREFLIGHT.json. External human
    peer review and Palomar acceptance are not established. The complete
    A+B18 Lean build, literal statement check, 37-test regression suite
    and owner audit passed in verification/d18-final-retry/ at
    2026-11-24T08:56:01Z. The separate cumulative source rebuild and
    compiled-interface comparison also passed. The interface digest is
    0da75f6ec67460498e6f5a13890e8d06a76dd9dad1739c7f433af31e0b51c3d2.
    The selected final proofs and their exported dependencies passed all
    three bundled checking components and the supplemental approved
    con-ron replay. These component checks do not assert a full official
    Palomar workflow pass or external human peer review.
    The new local Comparator attempt is recorded as blocked by the bwrap
    tmpfs setup failure, not accepted. No older certificate substitutes
    for the new release checks or for official registry verification.

alignment:
  namespace: "AkopyanSixfold"
  statements:
    - source: "Supplied theorem A"
      lean: "AkopyanSixfold.tverberg_counterexample"
      module: "Solution"
      status: "proved; full Lean build and owner audit passed"
      note: "Almost-six embedding of Delta^35 into R^6; unchanged statement."
    - source: "Requested full convex six-partition statement for 17 < d"
      lean: "AkopyanSixfold.convex_partition_counterexample_gt_17"
      module: "AkopyanResearch.Completion.DimensionEighteen"
      status: "proved unconditionally; full Lean build and owner audit passed"
